{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_slice_2", "label": "Slice 2 \u2014 The Job Queue, and Ingest That Survives a Crash", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Three defects in synchronous ingest drive the slice: the request is the unit of durability, the failure list lives only in a response body, and one scan is served by exactly one process \u2014 and a metered worker fleet that cannot split a folder is not a fleet."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_table", "label": "job table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "batch_id is a grouping column with a partial dequeue index; job_done_has_outcome is an equivalence while job_failed_has_reason is only an implication, because a retrying job legitimately holds a last error while pending."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_lease_dequeue", "label": "FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED Lease Dequeue", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_lease_reclamation_in_dequeue", "label": "Lease Reclamation Folded Into the Dequeue", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "No sweeper process exists, so no sweeper process can be the thing that died. attempts increments on reclamation exactly as on retry, so the poison-pill case is capped by the same counter; the cap check lives in the loop rather than the SQL, because excluding exhausted rows in the WHERE clause would leave them running with an expired lease forever."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_listen_notify_floor", "label": "LISTEN/NOTIFY as an Optimization Over a Polling Floor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "NOTIFY fires into the void when nothing is listening, so a worker that starts after an enqueue would never learn about that work if notification were the only path. The polling floor is the correctness mechanism; a test disables the listener entirely so the property cannot decay into 'notify happens to be what works'."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_handler_trait", "label": "JobHandler trait", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "The layering rule forbids exactly the edge a naive worker loop would need, which produces the better design: lapidary-jobs owns delivery and policy and knows nothing about meshes; lapidary-ingest owns one file's work and knows nothing about leases."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_handler_error", "label": "HandlerError (Permanent | Transient)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "When in doubt the classification is Transient: a retried permanent failure costs one wasted parse, while a non-retried transient failure costs the user a file."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_parse_failure_terminal", "label": "A Parse Failure Is Terminal on the First Attempt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "The bytes are content-addressed and immutable, so parsing the same blob again is guaranteed to produce the same error. The generic 'retry everything N times' default is wrong here for a reason specific to this system rather than a matter of taste."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_part_name_unique_per_library", "label": "part_name_unique_per_library Constraint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Lease expiry means two workers can genuinely run the same job concurrently, and no amount of checking harder fixes it because the check is not atomic with the insert. The loser's unique violation maps to Outcome::Skipped, making at-least-once delivery effectively-once at the only place that can enforce it. Its key must agree with library_holds's filter."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_batch_status", "label": "BatchStatus", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "failed is capped at 100 and ordered by (created_at, id); the id tiebreaker is load-bearing because a whole batch is inserted in one transaction and Postgres's now() is constant per transaction, so ordering by created_at alone discriminates nothing."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_batch_id_grouping_column", "label": "batch_id Is a Grouping Column, Not a Row", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "There is no batch entity to keep consistent, so nothing can be stale because nothing is denormalized. The one cost is that a batch that enqueued nothing has no status resource and 404s."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_scoped_status_route", "label": "Library-Scoped Batch Status Route", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "A batch id is a uuid the caller might hold from any source, and content addressing is not authorization. Scoping the route makes the ownership check structural rather than a step someone can forget to write."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_graceful_shutdown_releases_leases", "label": "Graceful Shutdown Releases Leases", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "In-flight jobs go back to pending with run_after = now(), so a planned restart resumes instantly instead of waiting out a 60-second lease. A crash does not get this, which is what lease expiry is for; only one of the two paths can run cleanup code."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_worker_loop", "label": "The Worker Loop", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "The concurrency permit is acquired before the dequeue, never after: leasing a job we have no capacity to start would burn lease time in a queue, and a lease that expires while the job waits is indistinguishable from a crashed worker."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_no_heartbeats_yet", "label": "Lease Heartbeats Deferred", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "A 200 ms mesh ingest against a 60-second lease would renew a lease with 59.8 seconds left \u2014 ceremony that still has to be tested and can still be wrong. renew_lease lands when a job can realistically outlive its lease, which is STEP ingest through the OCCT sidecar."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_slice_2", "target": "specs_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_design_slice_1", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_lease_dequeue", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_lease_reclamation_in_dequeue", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_lease_dequeue", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_worker_loop", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_lease_dequeue", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_worker_loop", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_handler_trait", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_worker_loop", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_listen_notify_floor", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_worker_loop", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_graceful_shutdown_releases_leases", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_handler_trait", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_handler_error", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_parse_failure_terminal", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_handler_error", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_design_lapidary_jobs", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_handler_trait", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_design_lapidary_jobs", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_worker_loop", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_design_lapidary_ingest", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_handler_trait", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_part_name_unique_per_library", "target": "specs_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_design_library_holds", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_part_name_unique_per_library", "target": "specs_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_design_part_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_batch_status", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_table", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_batch_status", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_batch_id_grouping_column", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_scoped_status_route", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_batch_status", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_design_lapidary_api", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_scoped_status_route", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_design_lapidary_db", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_listen_notify_floor", "target": "specs_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_design_lapidary_db", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_handler_trait", "target": "specs_2026_09_01_phase_0a_foundation_design_crate_layering", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_no_heartbeats_yet", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_lease_dequeue", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_slice_2", "target": "specs_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_design_hash_first_short_circuit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}